        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Lesson Plan Document</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            color: #000;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin-left: auto;\n            margin-right: auto;\n        }\n        .content-block {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .underline {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n        .italic {\n            font-style: italic;\n        }\n        .bold {\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .blackboard-box {\n            border: 1px solid #000;\n            padding: 30px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            text-align: center;\n            width: 60%;\n        }\n        .blackboard-box p {\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .blackboard-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .chinese-title {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .indent {\n            text-indent: 2em;\n        }\n        .red-text {\n            color: #a00; /* Approximating the reddish color in the image */\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        (2) Read the passage for the second time and answer some questions.<br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">Q1:What's the small talk?</span><br>\n        It's a common form of communication.<br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">Q2:What's the important thing of the small talk?</span><br>\n        It is important to smile and keep the conversation light and humorous.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        Step 4:Post-reading<br>\n        Role play: supposing that you are in a new class. And please make a small<br>\n        talk with your classmates.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        Step 5:Summary and homework<br>\n        Summary: Make a summary with the whole class.<br>\n        Homework: Finish the exercises on the book and share what we have<br>\n        learned with your parents.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        5.Blackboard design\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blackboard-box\">\n        <p class=\"blackboard-title\">Small talk</p>\n        <p>Q1:What's the small talk?</p>\n        <p>Q2:What's the important thing about small talk?</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"chinese-title\">\n        逐字稿\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        Greeting: <span class=\"underline\">Hello, everyone, nice to see you again. How was everything</span><br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">going? Great? Not bad? I'm so glad to hear that.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        Warm up:<br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">How about singing a song to cheer you up? &lt;We are the world.&gt;</span><br>\n        <span class=\"italic\">We are the world, we are the children. We are the ones who make a</span><br>\n        <span class=\"italic\">brighter day. So let's start giving.</span><br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">OK, are you happy now? It's time for class.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        Lead-in:\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block indent\">\n        I watched a very interesting video and now I want to share it with<br>\n        you.<span class=\"red-text\">(视频导入)</span> Do you want to see it? Well, let's look at the PPT. <span class=\"red-text\">(手指屏幕)</span><br>\n        What can you see in the video?\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block indent\">\n        <span class=\"underline\">Yes, some people. Who are they? Yes, they are some businessmen.</span><br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">What are they doing? Right, they are chatting with one another before</span><br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">having a meeting, and the topic they are talking about is very funny, so the</span><br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">atmosphere is relaxing, right? We call it small talk. Do you know why they</span><br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">do so before such an important and serious meeting?</span><span class=\"red-text\">(互动引导到主题)</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block indent\">\n        Well, today we will learn something about this. We will learn <span class=\"underline\">small</span><br>\n        <span class=\"underline\">talk.</span><span class=\"red-text\">(板书标题)</span>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
